cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with
  Arkhangelsky et al. (2021) for the underlying synthetic
  difference-in-differences estimator.
type: software
title: "wsynthdid: Weighted Synthetic Difference-in-Differences"
abstract: >-
  An R package extending the synthdid estimator of Arkhangelsky et al. (2021)
  with researcher-specified weights on treated units and post-treatment
  periods, size-stratified and staggered-adoption variants, weighted
  bootstrap, jackknife, and placebo variance estimators with cluster-robust
  options, and event-study decomposition.
